ings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T18:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T18:31:36Z","body":"I am upgrading from Godot 4.6.1 to 4.7.1 and my test team noticed this issue. \n\nI used this GLB from Khronos to verify the issue and my workaround: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets/main/Models/VertexColorTest/glTF-Binary/VertexColorTest.glb\n\n@tciviero -- Code was moved around causing `_parse_meshes` to read from `has_vertex_color` before it is written to. Code that used to run after `has_vertex_color` was set to true was hoisted up so that it runs earlier.\n\nHere is where code is reading early: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51105ccbe58381774ecd7a7486d564b202a5192e/modules/gltf/gltf_document.cpp#L1481\n\nHere is where code is setting: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51105ccbe58381774ecd7a7486d564b202a5192e/modules/gltf/gltf_document.cpp#L1659\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208222865/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208534811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120625#issuecomment-5208534811","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120625","id":5208534811,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNnPvGw","user":{"login":"tciviero","id":179772110,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrcazg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179772110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero","html_url":"https://github.com/tciviero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T19:23:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T19:23:20Z","body":"Thanks for the detailed context and pointing right to the lines, @brycehutchings! That helps a lot. I am currently wrapping up some prior PR fixes and will be away from my main setup for a brief bit, but I'll dive deep into this as soon as I'm back.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5208534811/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]